  "reason": "The old standalone mutable authoring lexer/parser graph has no production callers after replacement of the old emitter. BGCS3 deliberately has no old public API compatibility layer. These implementation tests exercise the retired graph, not the native frontend or the neutral binding pipeline. Authoring C# syntax transformations use Roslyn; native C/C++ macro facts and expressions use the Clang frontend. Removing this unused graph is not feature or release certification.",
